  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to entrepreneurship and employment along the Azov Sea costline</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project aims to boost the current support to entrepreneurship development, jobs creation, business skills advancement and accessing markets in the conflict-affected environment, helping to improve resilience of local population affected by the conflict and prevent further deterioration of the economic situation in Donetsk and Zaporizhzhia regions along the Azov see coastal line of Ukraine. 

The project address major obstacles to business start-up and scale-up holistically, by providing local conflict-affected population including women, youth and IDPs with access to information, access to skills and networks, access to finance and access to expanded national/international markets.</narrative>
  </description>
